{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o064a","title":"太后令废曹芳归齐遣高柔告宗庙","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o064a-account","label":"《三少帝纪》正文","text":"本条记载所载令书／奏文的主张：太后令废曹芳归齐遣高柔告宗庙；罪状不据此判为独立已证事实。","evidence":["shaodi-e-o064a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"mingdi-p0054","role":"发令","evidence":["shaodi-e-o064a-q"]},{"person":"wendi-p0129","role":"被废","evidence":["shaodi-e-o064a-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0017","role":"奉策","evidence":["shaodi-e-o064a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":254,"label":"秋九月甲戌","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"shaodi-y254","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"shaodi-q-o059","basis":"秋九月甲戌"},"evidence":["shaodi-e-o064a-q","shaodi-q-o059","shaodi-q-b-91c7db3288e80e5b9e4b"]},"ordering_evidence":"shaodi-e-o064a-q","source_order":[4,272,"O064a"],"order":1117}],"persons":[{"id":"mingdi-p0054","name":"郭皇后（曹叡后）","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0017","name":"高柔","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0129","name":"曹芳","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o064a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-b916308f11642562cd49","layer":"original","quote":"甲戌〖16〗，太后令曰：“皇帝芳春秋已长〖17〗，不亲万机；耽淫内宠，沈漫女德；日延倡优〖18〗，纵其丑谑；迎六宫家人留止内房〖19〗，毁人伦之序〖20〗，乱男女之节；恭孝日亏，悖傲滋甚：不可以承天绪，奉宗庙。使兼太尉高柔奉策〖21〗，用一元大武告于宗庙〖22〗：遣芳归藩于齐，以避皇位。”﹝二﹞","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":271,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":148,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-91c7db3288e80e5b9e4b","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-91c7db3288e80e5b9e4b","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗六年：嘉平六年（公元 254）。己丑：旧历初一日。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":275,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-386affd091adab4ef2df","start":0,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o059","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-83849af55ebd17291970","layer":"original","quote":"六年春二月，己丑〖1〗，镇东将军毌丘俭上言：“昔诸葛恪围合肥新城，城中遣士刘整出围〖2〗，传消息，为贼所得。考问所传，语整曰：‘诸葛公欲活汝，汝可具服〖3〗。’整骂曰：‘死狗，此何言也！我当必死为魏国鬼！不苟求活逐汝去也。欲杀我者，便速杀之！’终无他辞。又遣士郑像出城传消息。或以语恪，恪遣马骑寻围迹索，得像还。四五人的头面缚〖4〗，将绕城表。敕语像〖5〗，使大呼，言：‘大军已还洛，不如早降！’像不从其言，更大呼城中曰：‘大军近在围外，壮士努力！’贼以刀筑其口，使不得言。像遂大呼，令城中闻知。整、像为兵，能守义执节，子弟宜有差异〖6〗。”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":266,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":271,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
